# Full AWS + Terraform + GitHub Actions Deployment for Spring Boot Microservices

# Goal

We will build a complete deployment pipeline:

```text
GitHub Push
    ↓
GitHub Actions
    ↓
Terraform
    ↓
AWS EC2 Provisioning
    ↓
Docker Compose Deployment
    ↓
Spring Boot Microservices Running on AWS
```

This setup includes:

* Terraform Infrastructure as Code
* AWS EC2 provisioning
* Security groups
* Docker installation via EC2 user_data
* GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline
* SSH-based automated deployment
* Docker Compose orchestration

---

