# FINAL DEPLOYMENT FLOW

```text
Developer Pushes Code
        ↓
GitHub Actions Triggered
        ↓
Maven Builds JARs
        ↓
Files Copied to EC2
        ↓
Docker Compose Builds Containers
        ↓
Microservices Start
        ↓
Application Live on AWS
```
